# s4-engine-reply desktop wiring

## facts.ts (apps/desktop/src/main/host/browser-engine/facts.ts, the `dismissedDialog` object of the page facts)
Add the reason the guest state already holds (`record.dismissedDialog.reason`, 'unreachable' | 'early'):

    dismissedDialog: {
      type: dismissed.type,
      message: known(dismissed.message),
      at: record.dismissedDialogAt ?? 0,
      reason: dismissed.reason,
    },

and the matching `reason?: string` on the facts type of packages/protocol (regenerated from pending-rows/s4-engine-reply.rows). facts.test.mjs: the
dismissed dialog case expects `reason`. Until then the core engine says "its request never reached the browser" for every dismissed dialog.
